---
# GitHub Pages serves /404.html, with a 404 status, for every address that has no page
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /404.html
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
noindex: true
title: Page not found | PyDelhi
description: This page isn't on pydelhi.org.
---
<main class="lost">
  <div class="wrap">
    {#- the snake curled into the 0; script.js draws it (LOST PAGE), follows the pointer and talks when tapped #}
    <div class="lost-digits">
      <span class="lost-four" aria-hidden="true">4</span>
      <button type="button" class="lost-snake" id="lost-snake" aria-label="Poke the snake">
        <svg class="snake lost-ring" id="lost-ring" aria-hidden="true"></svg>
        <span class="lost-bubble" id="lost-bubble" role="status"></span>
      </button>
      <span class="lost-four" aria-hidden="true">4</span>
      <span class="sr-only">404</span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="lost-title">This page <em>slithered off.</em></h1>

    {#- a Python-style traceback with the address they asked for (filled in by script.js) -#}
    <div class="lost-trace">
      <p class="lost-trace-head">Traceback (most recent visit last):</p>
      <p class="lost-trace-line">You asked for <strong id="lost-path">this page</strong></p>
      <p class="lost-trace-error"><strong>PageNotFoundError:</strong> the link might be old, or the page was never here.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="lost-actions">
      <a href="/" class="btn-navy">Back to home <i class="ph ph-arrow-right"></i></a>
      <a href="{{ site.commudle }}" class="btn-line" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Next meetup on Commudle <i class="ph ph-arrow-up-right"></i></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>
